L["Investigate bloodstone corruption in Azsuna. Kira Iresoul proves her worth as the Council recruits new champions."] = "Untersuche die Blutsteinverderbnis in Azsuna. Kira Zornseele beweist ihren Wert, während der Rat neue Champions anwirbt."
